# TypeScript and tests

- Strict TypeScript. The catalog compiler is TypeScript 7.0.2. `apps/studio` and `apps/api` pin TypeScript 6.0.3.
- Libraries are built with `vp pack`. Apps keep their own CLIs.
- Unit tests use Vitest through `vp test`, except `apps/studio`, which uses `ng test` (Angular's Vitest builder).
- Import test helpers from `vite-plus/test`, not from `vitest`.
- Depend on workspace packages with the `workspace:*` protocol.
- Repository language is English.
- Do not commit secrets or real personal data. Version 1 uses seed and test data only.
